// Copy to Local.xcconfig for per-machine build settings. That file is
// gitignored; this example is not.
//
// Why this exists: if the repo lives in an iCloud-synced folder (~/Documents,
// ~/Desktop), Xcode code signing fails on extended attributes that the sync
// daemon attaches to files under the build directory. Redirecting the build
// output outside the synced tree avoids it.
//
// The path is relative to ios/Flutter/, so adjust it for your own machine.
//
// FLUTTER_BUILD_DIR=../../../../private/tmp/shohoj_flutter_build
